==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Helmut Krabbe]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Duche]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Assassin Bear]]s spawn after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>, delay 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|version 11.5]], the Assassin Bears were set to spawn every 900~86.7 seconds instead of just 900. It didn't work properly because the maximum time was lower than the minimum, so in practice nothing changed.

